  "body": "The maintainer ordered on 2026-11-18 to stop FreeBSD support.\n\nWhat changed:\n- `.github/workflows/release.yml`: removed the `freebsd` job, its `publish` `needs:` entry, `RESULT_FREEBSD` and the platform line of the release page. Updated the header comments.\n- Removed `.github/workflows/freebsd-backfill.yml`.\n- Removed FreeBSD from `README.md`, `site/content/` and `scripts/README.md`.\n- Removed the `freebsd-backfill.yml` entry from `.claude/skills/runners/SKILL.md`.\n- `CHANGELOG.md` history rows are unchanged. No new trigger.\n\nNot changed: `scripts/package-freebsd.sh` and the `Os::FreeBsd` code in `xtask/`. The xtask tests use them. A follow-up can remove them.\n\nNot exercised: `release.yml` did not run and no tag run was made. The YAML was not parsed by a YAML library (none was available). The job list and the `needs:` lists were checked by reading.\n\nProcess change: yes (the `runners` skill text).\n\nChangelog: Removed: FreeBSD is no longer a supported platform; releases carry no FreeBSD artifact.\n\nEffort: low\n\nFixes #2570\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
